cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "BMI-200 and BMI-MODES: peptide–protein binding-mode identification benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Two curated datasets of peptide–protein X-ray complexes for binding-mode
  identification: BMI-200, a 202-entry diversity set, and BMI-MODES, 31
  mode-discrimination sites with two to five experimentally supported poses each.
type: dataset
authors:
